@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@ Welcome to Nushell and thank you for considering contributing!
   - [Tests](#tests)
   - [Useful commands](#useful-commands)
   - [Debugging tips](#debugging-tips)
+  - [Experimental options](#experimental-options)
 - [Git etiquette](#git-etiquette)
